{"unit_id":"xiaohai-78__dsh-modes#card-zh","repo":"xiaohai-78/dsh-modes","commit":"a67235ab3cc273cb7ef8f831f7983449a23d67ec","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-modes 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模式管理插件，在 Settings 中提供模式列表和编辑页面，并通过配置服务保存模式覆盖。它可切换模式中的插件能力、编辑系统提示词和工具描述、按模式管理技能，并从模板或现有模式创建自定义模式；还支持合并内置模式更新、检查和升级插件。适合需要为不同会话配置能力边界、提示词或技能的 DSH Web 用户。安装需要 DSH Web；自动更新检查可关闭，检查时向配置的 npm registry 查询本插件版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:121","index.js:805","index.js:1079","index.js:1299","index.js:1706","client.js:1305","update.js:18"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaohai-78__dsh-modes#card-en","repo":"xiaohai-78/dsh-modes","commit":"a67235ab3cc273cb7ef8f831f7983449a23d67ec","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-modes adds a Modes page to DSH Web Settings. Users can switch plugins per mode, edit prompts and tool descriptions, manage skills, and create modes from templates or existing modes. It merges built-in updates. DSH Web is required; optional update checks query the configured npm registry.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:121","index.js:805","index.js:1079","index.js:1299","index.js:1706","client.js:1305","update.js:18"]}
