{"unit_id":"xiaohai-78__dsh-modes#feature-1","repo":"xiaohai-78/dsh-modes","commit":"a67235ab3cc273cb7ef8f831f7983449a23d67ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-modes 的功能「模式能力与自定义模式」：在 Web Settings 中查看模式、切换其中的插件行，并从模板或现有模式创建自定义模式。创建时会保存模式配置，复制模式还会复制相关提示词、工具描述和技能设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:805","index.js:850","client.js:1305"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaohai-78__dsh-modes#feature-2","repo":"xiaohai-78/dsh-modes","commit":"a67235ab3cc273cb7ef8f831f7983449a23d67ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-modes 的功能「模式提示词编辑」：用户可在页面编辑模式提示词并保存历史版本；提示词会校验变量并检测并发编辑冲突。启用 Live prompt 后，已运行会话可在后续步骤采用新提示词。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1079","index.js:1120","live-persona.js:24"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaohai-78__dsh-modes#feature-3","repo":"xiaohai-78/dsh-modes","commit":"a67235ab3cc273cb7ef8f831f7983449a23d67ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-modes 的功能「工具描述定制」：用户按模式编辑一个或多个工具的描述，也可恢复原文。模式内的处理行会替换发送给模型的工具描述字段，不改工具名称或参数定义。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1299","tool-edit.js:1","tool-descriptions.js:18"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaohai-78__dsh-modes#feature-4","repo":"xiaohai-78/dsh-modes","commit":"a67235ab3cc273cb7ef8f831f7983449a23d67ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-modes 的功能「按模式管理技能」：在技能视图中为模式开关技能或固定到已保存版本；技能策略行向该模式提供隐藏项或固定版本，变更后刷新技能目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1706","skill-policy.js:17","skill-policy.js:32"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaohai-78__dsh-modes#feature-5","repo":"xiaohai-78/dsh-modes","commit":"a67235ab3cc273cb7ef8f831f7983449a23d67ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-modes 的功能「合并内置模式更新」：当内置模式的插件行变化时，可将新内置配置与用户修改进行合并，并显示同步结果；冲突处理以用户值为优先。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:770","index.js:388","rebase.js:1"]}
